<h1 id="built-in-components">Built-in components<a href="#built-in-components" aria-label="Link to this section" class="lk-anchor">#</a></h1>
<aside data-kind="warning" class="lk-callout">
<p class="lk-callout-title">Mind the gap</p>
<div class="lk-callout-body">
<p>Callouts hold <strong>Markdown</strong>, including lists:</p>
<ul>
<li>one</li>
<li>two</li>
</ul>
</div>
</aside>
<aside data-kind="note" class="lk-callout">
<p class="lk-callout-title">Note</p>
<div class="lk-callout-body">A note by default, written inline.
</div>
</aside>
<div class="lk-steps">
<h3 id="install-the-cli">Install the CLI<a href="#install-the-cli" aria-label="Link to this section" class="lk-anchor">#</a></h3>
<p>Run <code>cargo install leptoskit_cli</code>.</p>
<h3 id="create-a-project">Create a project<a href="#create-a-project" aria-label="Link to this section" class="lk-anchor">#</a></h3>
<p>Run <code>lk new my_app</code>.</p>
</div>
